'''Date Masamune''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.3 Update|Version 2.3]] and can be unlocked by using the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] increases his range, damage and health. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] and [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]].

