==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Date Masamune was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Patched Up (Removed Combo)|Patched Up]].
*[[wikipedia:Date Masamune|Date Masamune]] was a famed samurai who fought during the Sengoku era and during the early Edo period. He was known for his fine horsemanship and stellar use of firearms, with the former being referenced in his design. The whole Date clan was actually renowned for the same reasons.
*Date Masamune's Normal Form somewhat resembles [[wikia:finalfantasy:Odin|Odin]] from Final Fantasy IV.

